{
  "name": "Saturday Pantry Nudge",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 18 * * 6"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "sched-sat",
      "name": "Saturday 6pm",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://127.0.0.1:8731/run",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\"cmd\":\"build-week\"}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 300000
        }
      },
      "id": "http-build",
      "name": "Build next week (food-runner)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "REPLACE-FROM-ADDRESS",
        "toEmail": "REPLACE-TO-ADDRESS",
        "subject": "Saturday: next week's plan is set — tweak before 8am",
        "emailFormat": "text",
        "text": "{{ $json.stdout.split('\\n').filter(l => l.includes('RESULT:')).join('\\n') || 'build-week returned no RESULT line' }}\n\nYour default week was auto-filled from the template (only empty days; anything you already planned or edited is untouched).\n\nReminders (5 minutes):\n1. Tandoor -> Foods: mark what you actually have as 'on hand' — sync subtracts it from the order\n2. Tandoor -> Meal Plan: tweak next week if you want (your edits stick)\n3. Kroger app: clear the cart from last week\n\nTomorrow 8am: n8n syncs plan + pantry into delivery-list.md, fills the Kroger cart, and emails the summary. You still review before checkout."
      },
      "id": "email-nudge",
      "name": "Email: pantry nudge",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "emailSmtp": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "smtp-food"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Saturday 6pm": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Build next week (food-runner)",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Build next week (food-runner)": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Email: pantry nudge",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "id": "blsnWwftvqD7WLXS",
  "active": false
}
